{"qid": "tt_t1_00009", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 49.67, "n_tokens": 236, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["侵权责任法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.72, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 354, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['侵权责任法'] tvc=0", "answer": "简短结论：**不能依照《侵权责任法》第六条处理；能否在2026年起诉，关键看诉讼时效和具体请求权基础，而不是该条本身。**\n\n1. **《侵权责任法》第六条已不再作为现行裁判依据**\n   - 《侵权责任法》自《民法典》2021年1月1日施行后已被废止。\n   - 2026年起诉，法院原则上适用**《民法典》第一千一百六十五条**，而不是《侵权责任法》第六条。\n   - 《民法典第一千一百六十五条》规定：“行为人因过错侵害他人民事权益造成损害的，应当承担侵权责任。依照法律规定推定行为人有过错，其不能证明自己没有过错的，应当承担侵权责任。”\n\n2. **2019年发生的事，是否还能起诉，要看诉讼时效**\n   - 一般侵权请求权的诉讼时效为**三年**，通常自权利人知道或者应当知道权利受到损害以及义务", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.048, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_侵权责任法_2009_6", "score": 0.8667, "type": "provision", "law": "侵权责任法", "article": 6, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_1165", "score": 0.6, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 1165, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_1166", "score": 0.4359, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 1166, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）渝01民初518号_1", "score": 0.1454, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）渝01民初518号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再664号_1", "score": 0.143, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再664号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）鲁01民终1326号_1", "score": 0.124, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）鲁01民终1326号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（20