{"qid": "tt_t1_00015", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 51.75, "n_tokens": 232, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.4, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 349, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "简短结论：**不能直接以《合同法》第二百一十一条作为你 2026 年起诉的请求权基础**，理由如下。\n\n**1. 《合同法》已失效**\n\n《中华人民共和国合同法》自 **2021 年 1 月 1 日**《中华人民共和国民法典》施行之日起废止（《民法典》第一千二百六十条明确列举废止的法律，其中包括《合同法》）。因此 2026 年起诉时，法院不会以《合同法》作为裁判依据。\n\n**2. 应适用《民法典》，内容基本延续**\n\n你所引规则在《民法典》中对应的是：\n\n- **《民法典》第六百八十条第二款**：借款合同对支付利息没有约定的，视为没有利息。\n- **《民法典》第六百八十条第三款**：自然人之间借款合同对支付利息约定不明确的，视为没有利息。\n\n也就是说，你引用的《合同法》第二百一十一条的实质", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.051, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）津02民初1653号_1", "score": 0.1232, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）津02民初1653号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏05民再1869号_1", "score": 0.1196, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏05民再1869号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）川01民再1226号_1", "score": 0.1196, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）川01民再1226号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民再2114号_1", "score": 0.1196, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民再2114号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）浙01民再1253号_1", "score": 0.1196, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）浙01民再1253号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）浙01民初2525号_1", "score": 0.1196, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article"