{"qid": "tt_t1_00021", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 61.48, "n_tokens": 228, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.44, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 342, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "关于您的问题，分两个层面回答：\n\n**一、能否适用《合同法》第一百一十四条**\n\n《合同法》已于2021年1月1日《民法典》施行时废止。根据《民法典》时间效力的相关规定，2021年1月1日之后新受理的案件，原则上适用《民法典》的规定。您所述2016年发生的事实，若属于《民法典》施行前的法律事实引起的民事纠纷，一般应适用当时的法律即《合同法》；但《民法典》第五百八十五条与《合同法》第一百一十四条内容基本一致，即便适用《民法典》，规则实质相同。\n\n因此，**不能简单地说\"现在起诉就一律适用《合同法》第一百一十四条\"**，需根据法律事实发生时间及《民法典》时间效力规定确定适用哪部法律，但两条规定内容一致，对结果影响不大。\n\n**二、现在（2026年）能否起诉**\n\n能否起诉，关键看", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.06, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_114", "score": 0.8986, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 114, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_585", "score": 0.6764, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 585, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_584", "score": 0.4342, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 584, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民初2062号_0", "score": 0.19, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民初2062号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）沪01民再1608号_0", "score": 0.19, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）沪01民再1608号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民终2751号_0", "score": 0.1866, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民终2751号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京01民终148