{"qid": "tt_t2_00009", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 47.32, "n_tokens": 227, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["婚姻法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.4, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 341, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已修订 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['婚姻法'] tvc=0", "answer": "您引用的《婚姻法》第三十二条原文本身没有错，但需要说明一个重要变化：**《婚姻法》已于2021年1月1日随《民法典》施行而废止**，原婚姻法的内容被《民法典》婚姻家庭编吸收和修改。因此，现在处理离婚问题应直接适用《民法典》，而不是再引用《婚姻法》。\n\n就您引用的这一句而言，其核心含义在现行法下仍然成立，对应的是**《民法典》第一千零七十九条**：\n\n> 夫妻一方要求离婚的，可以由有关组织进行调解或者直接向人民法院提起离婚诉讼。人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；如果感情确已破裂，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。\n\n也就是说：\n\n1. **“可由有关部门调解或直接起诉”**——现行法表述为“可以由有关组织进行调解或者直接向人民法院提起离婚诉讼”，含义基本一致，调解不是起诉的前置程序", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.046, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_婚姻法_2001修正_32", "score": 0.9125, "type": "provision", "law": "婚姻法", "article": 32, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_1079", "score": 0.2829, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 1079, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民终2927号_0", "score": 0.2047, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民终2927号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京03民终1898号_0", "score": 0.2047, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京03民终1898号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪02民终2843号_0", "score": 0.1709, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪02民终2843号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京02民终2113号_0", "score": 0.1706, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京02民终2113号"}, {"doc_id"