{"qid": "tt_t3_00021", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 33.35, "n_tokens": 203, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.6667, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 305, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=现行有效 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "《中华人民共和国民法典》现行有效。\n\n《民法典》于2021年1月1日起施行，至今未被废止，仍是处理民事纠纷的主要法律依据。起诉状中可直接援引《中华人民共和国民法典》相关条文。\n\n需注意：若纠纷涉及的法律事实发生在2021年1月1日之前，则适用法律时需结合《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》判断——原则上适用当时的法律、司法解释（该规定第二条），但符合特定情形时可适用《民法典》（该规定第三条）。因此，起诉状中援引《民法典》时，建议先确认涉案法律事实的发生时间，以免法律适用有误。\n\n以上依据参考资料中的《民法典时间效力规定》第二条、第三条，仅供参考；具体适用请结合案件事实判断。", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.032, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_143", "score": 0.6682, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 143, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）津02民终252号_0", "score": 0.5441, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）津02民终252号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）津02民终1055号_0", "score": 0.5441, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）津02民终1055号"}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典时间效力规定_2020_3", "score": 0.3195, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典时间效力规定", "article": 3, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典时间效力规定_2020_2", "score": 0.3005, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典时间效力规定", "article": 2, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_144", "score": 0.2781, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 144, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_10", "score": 0.2613, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典"