{"qid": "tt_t3_00027", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 38.22, "n_tokens": 240, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.55, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 361, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=现行有效 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "《劳动合同法》目前仍然有效，可以作为裁判依据。\n\n说明如下：\n\n1. **效力状态**：《中华人民共和国劳动合同法》由全国人大常委会制定，自2008年1月1日起施行，2012年12月28日修正，现行有效，未被废止。它是审理劳动争议案件的核心实体法依据之一。\n\n2. **裁判依据**：法院审理劳动争议时，通常同时适用《劳动合同法》与《劳动法》《劳动争议调解仲裁法》等。例如：\n   - 用人单位以\"严重违反规章制度\"为由解除劳动合同的，依据《劳动合同法》第三十九条；\n   - 因解除决定发生争议、用人单位负举证责任的，依据《劳动争议调解仲裁法》第六条及《劳动合同法》相关规定。\n\n3. **关于你提供的参考资料**：这些文书均标注为\"合成数据、不对应任何真实案件\"，且判决理由部分只笼统写\"依照相关法律规定\"，未列明具体", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.037, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2019）渝01民再2817号_1", "score": 0.1042, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）渝01民再2817号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京03民终2621号_1", "score": 0.1042, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京03民终2621号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京01民初2661号_1", "score": 0.1042, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京01民初2661号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏05民终957号_1", "score": 0.1042, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏05民终957号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）川01民初1222号_1", "score": 0.1042, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）川01民初1222号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）粤01民再1401号_1", "score": 0.1042, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "art